PDF Export, Set Filter Support for Advanced Filter, Custom Filter Option Support in Advanced Filter, Continuous Column Auto-sizing, Custom Renderers for Column Items in Columns Tool Panel

## What's New

AG Grid {% migrationVersion() %} adds important new features - [PDF Export](./pdf-export/), [Set Filter Support for Advanced Filter](./filter-advanced-columns/#set-filters), [Custom Filter Option Support in Advanced Filter](./filter-advanced-custom-filter-options/), [Continuous Column Auto-sizing](./column-sizing/#continuous-auto-sizing), [Custom Renderers for Column Items in Columns Tool Panel](./tool-panel-columns/#custom-column-labels).
These improvements involve no breaking changes as listed below.

